# Eidolon canned stub rootfs

This directory is a **minimal hermetic fixture**, not a bootable Linux userland.

The canned pipeline (`unikernel::pack::canned` / `eidolon-canned-rootfs`) copies
this tree (or seeds an equivalent layout) and stages `eidolon-vsock-agent` at
`usr/local/bin/eidolon-vsock-agent`.

Real Ext4 release disks are built on Linux with `mkfs.ext4` / `virt-make-fs`
(or `DockerToExt4`) and a musl `eidolon-vsock-agent` binary. Versioned GH
release staging + pin/fetch: see `docs/guides/gh-ext4-release.md` (default
pin unpublished until one-shot publish).
